@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Safehome Security System

[*] --> StartupCheck

state "Startup Check" as StartupCheck
state FaultyStartup
state ReadyToUse
state ResetSystem
state ActivateSystem
state TurnOffSystem
state MonitoringStarted
state AlarmActivated
state FalseAlarmOrTimeEnds
state ContinueMonitoring
state NormalMode

StartupCheck --> FaultyStartup : [Problem]
StartupCheck --> ReadyToUse : [No Problem]

ReadyToUse --> ResetSystem
ReadyToUse --> ActivateSystem
ReadyToUse --> TurnOffSystem

ActivateSystem --> MonitoringStarted
MonitoringStarted --> AlarmActivated : [Sensor Triggered]
AlarmActivated --> FalseAlarmOrTimeEnds : [False Alarm or Time Ends]
FalseAlarmOrTimeEnds --> ContinueMonitoring
ContinueMonitoring --> MonitoringStarted

TurnOffSystem --> NormalMode : [User Enters Password]

@enduml
